roulette (2.5.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Packaged for PyPI: pipx install roulette-game.
  * Fix: terminals that report a width of 0 columns no longer make every
    line wrap at 30 columns on older Pythons (such as macOS's 3.9).
  * README opens with the hook, a demo GIF and one-line installs.

